      "observed_at_basis": "TrackMessage.baseTime: a TrackSegment carries no relTime of its own, and this one carries no points to take an instant from",
      "retraction_basis": "a TrackSegment with a Confidence and no track points is a statement ABOUT a history rather than part of one (\u00a72.1.1.2.3 c), and Track.samples requires at least one sample \u2014 so it becomes an Event. The retraction is carried and NOT applied: applying it means holding the object it retracts",
